B.aen=new A.ap("How do I get something done?","Open Get Help, describe what you need, set a price or request a quote, and a nearby Runner takes it on. You confirm when the work is complete.")
B.ae7=new A.ap("When am I charged?","Your card is held for the amount shown at booking. You're charged only after the job is completed and confirmed, up to that amount \u2014 never more.")
B.aeh=new A.ap("Who are the Runners?","Independent workers and businesses. For licensed trades (plumbing, electrical, HVAC), Runners must upload credentials and be verified before they can take those jobs.")
B.ae8=new A.ap("How do I become a Runner?","Open the Earn tab and apply. It takes a few minutes, and may include identity verification and, for trades, credential checks.")
B.ae9=new A.ap("Something went wrong with a job.","Contact support and we'll help resolve it. Refunds may be issued at our discretion and as required by law.")
